Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:35.32,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,I brought the client who needs \Nan investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:43.66,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,This is Aya Sukiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.46,0:01:45.80,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,An invisible person?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.02,0:01:47.00,Main,Aya,0,0,0,,You are too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.55,0:01:49.48,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Looks like Tonome in drag.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.25,0:01:53.18,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,You don't have to say every thought \Nthat enters your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.68,0:01:56.18,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,"Tonome-san in drag"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.47,0:01:58.60,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. She's a bit tactless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.69,0:02:01.92,Main,Aya,0,0,0,,You're Tonome-san, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.92,0:02:02.56,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.95,0:02:06.36,Main,Aya,0,0,0,,I've never met an invisible \Nperson in the city before!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.36,0:02:09.76,Main,Aya,0,0,0,,I'm so relieved to have \Na member of my species helping me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.22,0:02:11.18,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm happy to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.52,0:02:14.56,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Please let us help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.39,0:02:18.27,Main - Top,Jarashi,0,0,0,,What a coincidence!{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.42,0:02:19.12,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Shizuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.27,0:02:20.01,Main - Top,Tonome,0,0,0,,I was surprised too.{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.64,0:02:21.44,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Feeling self-conscious?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.01,0:02:24.83,Main - Top,Madarito,0,0,0,,I thought the Tonome Detective Agency \Nwould be able to handle this case.{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.84,0:02:24.81,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,H-How could you say that? She's a client!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.81,0:02:26.08,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.83,0:02:29.13,Main - Top,Aya,0,0,0,,It really must be a good sign!{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.08,0:02:28.74,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Seems like they're getting \Nalong real well, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.74,0:02:31.70,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,That happens when you don't run \Ninto your own kind very often.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.13,0:02:33.20,Main - Top,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's also my first time doing a job \Nfor a member of my species.{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.20,0:02:37.88,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Well... Akira-san's voice does sound \Na bit friendlier than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.63,0:02:36.96,Main - Top,Aya,0,0,0,,Tonome-san, were you born \Nin the invisible person village?{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.96,0:02:39.92,Main - Top,Tonome,0,0,0,,No, I was raised outside of it.{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.88,0:02:39.90,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,So you are self-conscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.90,0:02:41.63,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,It's cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.92,0:02:41.64,Main - Top,Aya,0,0,0,,So was I!{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.97,0:02:43.72,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,MEETING ROOM
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.96,0:02:45.94,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You've been accused of theft?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.35,0:02:47.22,Main,Aya,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.63,0:02:50.92,Main,Aya,0,0,0,,The money went missing \Nfrom a safe at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.06,0:02:54.72,Main,Aya,0,0,0,,No one was visible \Non the security cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.17,0:03:01.45,Main,Aya,0,0,0,,The vice president decided that \Nan invisible person must have done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.10,0:03:04.24,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,What did the president say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.24,0:03:06.01,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,The president is in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.01,0:03:07.75,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,The vice president's \Nbeen standing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:09.87,Main,Aya,0,0,0,,I didn't do it, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.08,0:03:15.57,Main,Aya,0,0,0,,But the vice president seems \Nconvinced it was me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.36,0:03:18.63,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Even though he has no proof?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.09,0:03:19.73,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.28,0:03:22.64,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,And it's difficult to get an alibi,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.82,0:03:26.64,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,since invisible people can't \Nbe identified by their faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.38,0:03:30.79,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Sukiya-san was elsewhere that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.79,0:03:34.97,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,but she doesn't know how to prove \Nit was her to establish an alibi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.56,0:03:38.49,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.71,0:03:41.39,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I promise I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.66,0:03:45.91,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,MEETING ROOM
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.13,0:03:48.28,Main,Aya,0,0,0,,Please do. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.29,0:03:57.24,Main,Vice President,0,0,0,,I'm Gamaike. I'm standing \Nin for the president.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.24,0:04:02.93,Main,Vice President,0,0,0,,So she's hired a lawyer \Nand a private investigator, has she?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.49,0:04:07.73,Main,Vice President,0,0,0,,And you're an invisible person, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.73,0:04:11.96,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Do you think I could see the video \Ndata from the security cameras?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.44,0:04:15.94,Main,Vice President,0,0,0,,Well... Of course you may.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.13,0:04:19.27,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.94,0:04:24.26,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It seems nobody interacted \Nwith the safe between
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:27.49,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,when you last closed it and \Nwhen you opened it yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.49,0:04:29.46,Main,Vice President,0,0,0,,Yes, and that's why!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.46,0:04:33.08,Main,Vice President,0,0,0,,You invisible people have \Nthat "full invisibility" thing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.08,0:04:36.96,Main,Vice President,0,0,0,,where you make your \Nclothes vanish too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:40.12,Main,Vice President,0,0,0,,I'm thinking she must have used that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.81,0:04:42.98,Main,Vice President,0,0,0,,E-Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.99,0:04:45.79,Main,Vice President,0,0,0,,Where did the detective go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.54,0:04:55.36,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.31,0:05:02.24,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,That's how full invisibility works.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.63,0:05:07.52,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,But it only makes us \Ninvisible, not intangible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.52,0:05:09.48,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Therefore...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.77,0:05:15.54,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,There's no way she could steal money \Nfrom a safe that wasn't open.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.32,0:05:18.71,Main,Vice President,0,0,0,,W-Well then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.88,0:05:21.92,Main,Vice President,0,0,0,,I suppose I got the wrong idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.92,0:05:27.34,Main,Vice President,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. The money went missing, \Nso I was just so shaken...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.34,0:05:30.85,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,We actually have another \Nvideo to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.22,0:05:33.96,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Starting a few days after you took \Nover for the president,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.96,0:05:38.33,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,you were seen secretly depositing bills \Ninto an ATM every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.78,0:05:41.72,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Fearing that you would be found out,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:44.57,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,you decided to exploit \NSukiya-san's attributes
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.12,0:05:47.97,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,to lay the suspicion on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.32,0:05:50.18,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.47,0:05:56.64,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,I believe that would \Nqualify as defamation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.52,0:05:58.88,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Embezzlement, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.53,0:06:01.80,Main,President,0,0,0,,What's going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.43,0:06:04.54,Main,Vice President,0,0,0,,M-Mr. President!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.54,0:06:08.69,Main,President,0,0,0,,What were you doing while \NI was hospitalized for appendicitis?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.69,0:06:11.69,Main,Vice President,0,0,0,,I-It was a spur-of-the-moment thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.69,0:06:15.18,Main,President,0,0,0,,This was clearly premeditated!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.35,0:06:21.26,Main,Aya,0,0,0,,Thank you! You saved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.72,0:06:24.64,Main,Aya,0,0,0,,The president explained \Neverything to the others,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.64,0:06:26.57,Main,Aya,0,0,0,,so I'll be able to keep my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.89,0:06:28.83,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm glad your name was cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.26,0:06:32.13,Main,Aya,0,0,0,,I really can't thank you enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.71,0:06:41.27,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Everyone, thank you for running \Nsuch a swift investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.69,0:06:46.70,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,We were able to solve the case before\Nclaims against our client went too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.34,0:06:49.66,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,And while you have so many \Nother duties to see to...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.66,0:06:53.36,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,We're fine. Shizuka made sure \Nall our schedules lined up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.04,0:06:56.26,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,We split it all up between\N the three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.66,0:06:59.03,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,It was Yako's idea in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.28,0:07:00.52,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san's idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.74,0:07:04.15,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,She wanted to do something to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.15,0:07:07.10,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I-I really didn't do anything serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.10,0:07:08.65,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I was mostly supporting the other two!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.65,0:07:11.95,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,And I'm sorry! \NI shouldn't have gone so far!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.10,0:07:14.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I mean, but... why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.92,0:07:16.22,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.43,0:07:19.75,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,Even though he has no proof?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.54,0:07:24.30,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,I could sense a little \Nanger in Akira-san's voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.82,0:07:26.91,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,But I'm sure I can't tell him that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.78,0:07:32.29,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Thank you, Shizuka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.13,0:07:37.18,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You allowed us to save our client.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.44,0:07:41.48,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.62,0:07:44.68,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,How about a little \Ncompany trip as thanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.80,0:07:48.55,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Hey, sounds great! \NI wanna go to the mountains!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.55,0:07:50.75,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Great idea! How about camping?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.75,0:07:53.86,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,You're coming too? \NYou don't even work here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.86,0:07:56.42,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,A mountain with a campground, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.42,0:07:57.32,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,That was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.32,0:08:00.20,Main - Top,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I can't wait for the tents and campfires!{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.20,0:08:02.18,Main - Top,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Daichi, we can drive them!{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.03,0:08:02.89,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It should be fun, right, Shizuka-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.70,0:08:05.69,Main - Top,Kikira,0,0,0,,That's fine, but what about your job?{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.80,0:08:06.75,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san's back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.69,0:08:08.76,Main - Top,Madaraito,0,0,0,,I'll take some paid days off, of course!{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.56,0:08:09.68,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes, it should be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.76,0:08:10.35,Main - Top,Kikira,0,0,0,,You're really into this, huh?{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.80,0:08:14.72,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,It's mountain time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.95,0:08:15.73,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,River time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.96,0:08:17.98,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Camping time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.40,0:08:19.02,Main - Top,Yako,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.02,0:08:21.14,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Can you two help?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.40,0:08:24.37,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,What's that asshole lawyer up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.37,0:08:25.48,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Setting up the smoker!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.74,0:08:27.91,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Why are you wearing \Nsunglasses, Shizuka-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.29,0:08:29.70,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You look very cool, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.84,0:08:33.71,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,With all the trees around, there's a \Ngood chance of taking a branch to the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.71,0:08:35.00,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,This is how I prevent that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.00,0:08:35.92,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.33,0:08:38.85,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,So, how can I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.85,0:08:42.95,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Would you mind grinding the beans \Nfor when we take a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.95,0:08:43.69,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.69,0:08:47.46,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Hey, I don't know how to put up a tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.46,0:08:49.46,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,How about chopping wood, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.46,0:08:50.97,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,You don't even need an ax!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.28,0:08:55.08,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You seem to like camping, Madaraito-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.37,0:08:58.24,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You got together most \Nof the camping equipment, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.86,0:09:03.23,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,I actually used to hate the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.49,0:09:07.37,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,But, thanks to Daichi, \NI've come to love them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.66,0:09:21.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.88,0:09:25.07,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Would you like to take a walk with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.22,0:09:31.24,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Aren't all the sounds soothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.81,0:09:34.22,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,The smells on the wind, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.52,0:09:36.84,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Would you prefer to slow down a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.84,0:09:38.69,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,No, this pace is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.82,0:09:42.62,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,There's no fence for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.62,0:09:44.89,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Would you prefer to walk \Non the far side of the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.03,0:09:47.68,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What's on the other side of the fence?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.68,0:09:49.60,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,A sharp incline, like a cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.40,0:09:51.78,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,We wouldn't want to fall off that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.27,0:09:56.05,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,But I feel safe knowing \Nyou're here, Akira-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.48,0:10:01.40,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I feel safe knowing you're \Nhere too, Shizuka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.66,0:10:02.99,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.84,0:10:07.57,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san had that scary experience \Nin the mountains that one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.58,0:10:11.88,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Are you really okay \Nwith a trip to the mountains?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.32,0:10:16.13,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I did have some \Nlingering trauma about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.44,0:10:19.28,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,but I feel like I can handle \Nanything if you're here,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.86,0:10:21.70,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,so I completely forgot about the trauma!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.44,0:10:25.16,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I-I'm sure I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.38,0:10:27.43,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Hey, there's a bench.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.71,0:10:28.68,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Let's have a sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.99,0:10:38.28,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Um... I'm sure I'm not worth \Nthat much to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.51,0:10:43.00,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,But you already helped with \Nthat invisible person case, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:44.70,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,That was nothing, really!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.70,0:10:45.75,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.19,0:10:46.93,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Just what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.64,0:10:50.87,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You don't usually get angry like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.04,0:10:55.77,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Did I frighten you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.77,0:10:57.43,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,That's not what I mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.61,0:11:02.13,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I was just thinking, if you were \Nthe one accused like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.51,0:11:07.79,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I start imagining it... \Nand it feels so sad and suffocating...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.90,0:11:13.40,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,But then I think that maybe I should \Nhave just minded my own business...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.43,0:11:16.16,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry about it so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.40,0:11:22.62,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san's sensations... His body heat, \Nhis smell... It's suddenly so intense!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.08,0:11:26.97,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Historically, invisible people \Nhave been treated with suspicion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.39,0:11:30.08,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,So I'm really glad that, \Nthanks to you and the others,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.08,0:11:33.95,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,we were able to clear \Nthe client's name completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.58,0:11:37.84,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,But more important than that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.25,0:11:39.95,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,A-Akira-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.84,0:11:44.85,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,He's pressed against \Nmy back... He's so warm!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.33,0:11:46.23,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You don't like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:48.81,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Nah... S'okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.58,0:11:55.52,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Did you just laugh? I felt \Nthe slight shaking in your body!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.09,0:12:01.59,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I can't hide my feelings \Nfrom you, Shizuka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.98,0:12:05.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,That's what makes me the happiest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.56,0:12:09.20,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I want you to uncover \Nmore things about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.07,0:12:19.04,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,W-Was that just...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.36,0:12:20.40,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I kissed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.40,0:12:24.43,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Should I not have?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.60,0:12:27.01,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,No, it was okay, really!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.55,0:12:30.93,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Is it time to get back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.03,0:12:33.86,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.83,0:12:38.12,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Could we stay like this a bit longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.00,0:12:42.22,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shall I do it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.84,0:12:46.44,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Well... I would find that... \Nunobjectionable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.65,0:12:53.33,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Hey, they've been gone a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.33,0:12:54.96,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Here, all peeled.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.96,0:12:57.46,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,You gotta have curry when you're camping!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.81,0:13:07.44,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Takes you back, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.72,0:13:10.82,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,You know, I used to hate the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.36,0:13:13.88,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,I hated them so much, \NI started to hold a grudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.63,0:13:18.69,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,I'd think, "I'm gonna find the guy who \Ncame up with school trips to the mountains
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.69,0:13:20.58,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,and sue him for all he's worth."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.83,0:13:25.45,Flashback,Student 1,0,0,0,,Madaraito, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.88,0:13:28.70,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,You guys go on without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.09,0:13:29.66,Flashback,Student 1,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.03,0:13:30.73,Flashback,Student 2,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.04,0:13:34.51,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Yeah, go on. \NI'll catch up in my own time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.63,0:13:37.64,Flashback,Student 1,0,0,0,,Well... catch you later, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.44,0:13:46.69,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,{\i1}Man, everyone's leaving me behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.56,0:13:55.44,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,{\i1}I hate school trips!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.82,0:13:58.86,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.08,0:14:01.28,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kikira-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:04.65,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're in the same class, \Nbut we've never talked before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.46,0:14:07.12,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,{\i1}Still, what a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.44,0:14:10.10,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,{\i1}It feels nice to know \Nthat someone else is back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.26,0:14:19.40,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,{\i1}Having Kikira-kun here \Nhas helped me keep going...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.69,0:14:22.10,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.92,0:14:25.42,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't take anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.44,0:14:32.45,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Kikira-kun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.83,0:14:37.22,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Thanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.88,0:14:38.44,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.18,0:14:42.73,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,H-Hey, wait! I can't make you do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.15,0:14:46.94,Flashback,Kikira,0,0,0,,Then walk faster already. Sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.29,0:14:50.24,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,{\i1}That sudden spike of tsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.07,0:14:54.83,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,{\i0}SUMMIT
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.87,0:14:56.36,Flashback,Teacher,0,0,0,,It took you two a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.67,0:14:59.28,Flashback,Teacher,0,0,0,,Everyone else has already had lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.13,0:15:05.97,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Kikira-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.16,0:15:08.40,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Thanks for before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:10.64,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Want to eat lunch with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.32,0:15:12.91,Flashback,Kikira,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.52,0:15:14.78,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.03,0:15:16.76,Flashback,Kikira,0,0,0,,It's not like we're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.76,0:15:22.15,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,But... you helped me {\i1}even \Nthough{\i0} we aren't friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.31,0:15:25.91,Flashback,Kikira,0,0,0,,It's like how you give up a seat \Nto a random old person on the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.48,0:15:28.52,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,I'm like a random old person?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.72,0:15:29.28,Flashback,Kikira,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.66,0:15:33.72,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Come on! It feels awkward \Nfor me to eat by myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.90,0:15:35.52,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Eat with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.54,0:15:38.72,Flashback,Kikira,0,0,0,,Fine, if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.44,0:15:41.62,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,I'm so glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.24,0:15:46.09,Flashback - Italics,Madaraito,0,0,0,,I get it. Kikira-kun's an awkward guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.45,0:15:49.50,Flashback - Italics,Madaraito,0,0,0,,That's why I don't hear about him getting \Ndates, even though he's so good-looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.91,0:15:53.34,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,You can have some of mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.44,0:15:55.36,Flashback,Kikira,0,0,0,,The fried chicken, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.36,0:15:56.87,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,No shame at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.14,0:16:03.54,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Hey, let's sit together on the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.54,0:16:04.79,Flashback,Kikira,0,0,0,,If you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.08,0:16:12.59,Flashback - Italics,Madaraito,0,0,0,,{M}I fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.96,0:16:15.48,Flashback - Italics,Madaraito,0,0,0,,{M}Huh? Kikira-kun's asleep too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.11,0:16:19.42,Flashback - Italics,Madaraito,0,0,0,,{M}And while he was sleeping...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.72,0:16:24.52,Flashback - Italics,Madaraito,0,0,0,,{M}It's gonna be awkward when he wakes up...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.19,0:16:27.87,Flashback - Italics,Madaraito,0,0,0,,{M}I'll try not to wake him...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.48,0:16:36.68,Flashback - Italics,Madaraito,0,0,0,,{M}Maybe just for a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.64,0:16:45.79,Flashback,Kikira,0,0,0,,Gotta sleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.88,0:16:49.94,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Wait, you weren't sleeping?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.00,0:16:56.09,Flashback - Italics,Madaraito,0,0,0,,So I can stay like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.91,0:16:57.61,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.35,0:16:59.75,Flashback,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.29,0:17:03.16,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,And that was that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.16,0:17:05.88,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,We just kind of started dating!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.29,0:17:09.19,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Man, he's always been \Nexhausting like that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.19,0:17:12.55,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,So you held hands the whole way! \NThat's so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.71,0:17:18.81,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.98,0:17:22.23,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,The river's slow here, \Nso it should be a good spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.56,0:17:25.16,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,I hear the fishing's good here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.03,0:17:27.96,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Your build makes \Nanything look flashy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.81,0:17:31.68,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,And your stomach makes \Nanything look imposing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.51,0:17:34.70,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,I'll lay out the tarp over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.12,0:17:37.48,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Huh? Where are those other two?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.48,0:17:38.87,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,They said they'd catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.12,0:17:42.30,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,J-Jarashi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.75,0:17:45.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san? Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.44,0:17:46.52,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.91,0:17:48.98,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Jarashi-san's already gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.36,0:17:50.35,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Should I call her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.35,0:17:51.82,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,N-No...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.68,0:17:55.64,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I guess maybe you could do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.29,0:17:58.90,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Could you come inside for a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.50,0:18:01.51,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.57,0:18:08.25,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I've never worn this swimsuit before. \NI think I messed it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.23,0:18:13.34,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Huh? Akira-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.77,0:18:16.10,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, well... I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.63,0:18:20.88,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It looks like the other strap \Nis tangled in the frill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.88,0:18:23.74,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Oh, I thought that might be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.43,0:18:27.25,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Did you choose this swimsuit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.88,0:18:31.26,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,No, Jarashi-san picked it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.69,0:18:32.59,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.45,0:18:35.37,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's really charming. I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.37,0:18:38.26,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Really?! I'm so glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.10,0:18:40.05,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}The cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.47,0:18:42.10,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.80,0:18:44.92,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,This came with it as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.92,0:18:46.81,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Should I put it on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.81,0:18:47.54,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Let's do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.33,0:18:53.31,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.06,0:18:57.36,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Shizuka, you're adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.32,0:19:01.69,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Look at all of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.42,0:19:04.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Doesn't this feel nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.08,0:19:05.12,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:07.03,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Hey, the fish are heading your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.03,0:19:08.24,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.00,0:19:12.67,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.47,0:19:18.68,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Jarashi-san, you're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.68,0:19:20.54,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,That scared me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.85,0:19:23.80,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Come try it, Tonome!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.80,0:19:25.12,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.76,0:19:41.28,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I'm hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.28,0:19:43.20,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Yeah, I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.46,0:19:47.32,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Wait! Tonome, are you kinda jacked?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.20,0:19:50.52,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,When your shirt gets wet,\N it sticks to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.52,0:19:52.04,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,and I can see your body's contours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.04,0:19:54.08,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.44,0:19:57.40,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san is... well-muscled?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.59,0:20:03.75,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,A-Akira-san! Shouldn't \Nyou take your shirt off?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.75,0:20:06.13,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It's no fun to stand \Naround in wet clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.13,0:20:07.98,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.63,0:20:11.16,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I can't really do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.11,0:20:13.67,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.19,0:20:16.61,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, it's... how to put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.61,0:20:22.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,If I take off my shirt, you'll be able to \Nsee inside my bottoms from above...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.89,0:20:26.46,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,And it's just... a little embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.36,0:20:31.11,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I don't really get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.11,0:20:33.94,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I get it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.94,0:20:35.04,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,We can't see it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.04,0:20:38.24,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's just very embarrassing \Nfor invisible people!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.55,0:20:39.61,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Hey, Jarashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.61,0:20:42.31,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Catch some more fish. \NWe'll cook 'em for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.31,0:20:43.83,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Hey, great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.26,0:20:50.31,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.88,0:20:54.17,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Could I say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.17,0:20:55.94,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.11,0:21:02.64,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I don't like when other people... \Nuncover things about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.75,0:21:06.65,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.84,0:21:12.88,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.58,0:21:20.72,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt the fun, \Nbut could you do that somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.27,0:21:29.89,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,You can sleep if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.08,0:21:31.76,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.29,0:21:35.19,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Just let me know when you want \Nme to tag in at the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.40,0:21:37.52,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Like I'm gonna trust a guy who's yawning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.52,0:21:39.16,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,That's mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.56,0:21:42.00,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,There's that inscrutable \Nkindness of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.40,0:21:43.89,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Good thing I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.06,0:21:47.08,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,What in the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.70,0:21:49.50,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,The others are fast asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.88,0:21:52.40,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Coming home from a trip \Nalways tires you out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.15,0:21:56.21,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm actually still awake...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.97,0:22:00.11,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'd love to go on a trip just with her...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.90,0:22:03.25,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,But it's probably too soon for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.97,0:22:09.97,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,EPISODE 4: DON'T LET THEM EXPOSE YOU\NTO BE CONTINUED
